chore: bump version to v0.0.4

- Implement i18n system with detect_locale(), t() and i18n_get() functions
- Add automatic locale detection from $LANG / $LC_ALL / $LC_MESSAGES
- Support pt_BR as default locale and en_US as fallback
- Route all user-facing messages through i18n keys (no bare strings remain)
- Add i18n domains: prefix, usage, ssh, tutorial, git, interactive,
  input, tag, legacy, proc, section, summary
- Add .gitignore file (.msgtag, .msgcommit, editors, OS files, logs)
- Migrate README.md to English with i18n documentation section
- Consolidate and translate CHANGELOG.md to English (v0.0.1–v0.0.4)
- Convert script header comments to technical English
- Update VERSION variable to 0.0.4